@GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress = https://localhost:7136

# Sign in through the browser first (GET /login), then copy the full Cookie header
# (app_session, app_sessionC1, app_sessionC2) into the variable below.
@sessionCookie = app_session=chunks-2; app_sessionC1=...; app_sessionC2=...

### Who am I
GET {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/me
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Accept: application/json

### SCIM2 profile
GET {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Accept: application/json

### Select role after first login
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/select-role
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "Rider" }

### SCRUM-35 — deactivate without confirming (expect 400)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/account/deactivate
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confirm": false }

### SCRUM-35 — deactivate my account (expect 200, session cookie cleared; 409 while a trip is active)
# Irreversible from the app: only an Asgardeo admin can re-enable the account afterwards.
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/account/deactivate
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confirm": true }

### SCRUM-35 — anonymous caller (expect 401)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/account/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confirm": true }
